# GraphQL SortDirection

Use `RutDigital.Common.Domain.Paging.SortDirection`. Common already registers the GraphQL enum in `AddPagingTypes`. Do not declare another type named `SortDirection`.

```csharp
using RutDigital.Common.Domain.Paging;

public record ItemSortInput(SortDirection? Name);
```
